SCOPE

This licence covers the source code, configuration and documentation in this
repository. It does not cover the PrimeKG dataset, which is not distributed here.

PrimeKG is obtained from Harvard Dataverse (doi:10.7910/DVN/IXA7BM). Its use is
governed by the terms on that record and by the licences of its upstream sources.
The PrimeKG repository's own MIT licence applies to its software and tools, not to
the data. Result files committed here are derived statistics and model metrics, not
redistributed dataset records.

Model predictions in this repository are computational hypotheses. They measure
recovery of documented indications, not therapeutic efficacy, and are not validated
for clinical, diagnostic or regulatory use.
